{"id":"3b07826c415de765","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FTEvalRow.md","title":"FTEvalRow","display":"FTEvalRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FTEvalRow","parameters":["F","f","D","I","e","z1396","z1397","z1398"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FTEvalRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>F</span><span>f</span><span>D</span><span>I</span><span>e</span><span>z1396</span><span>z1397</span><span>z1398</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶集合语义。有序参数：<code>F</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>D</code>、<code>I</code>、<code>e</code>、<code>z1396</code>、<code>z1397</code>、<code>z1398</code>。</p>\n<p>固定结构与赋值下的项求值表；结构良构由外层 FModel 约束。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FTEvalRow F f D I e z1396 z1397 z1398)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists v\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t v z1398)\n      (and\n        (@ FTerm F f t)\n        (and\n          (@ FAssign D e)\n          (and\n            (in v D)\n            (or\n              (exists z1401 (and (@ FVar z1401 t) (@ App e z1401 v)))\n              (exists z1402\n                (exists z1403\n                  (exists z1404\n                    (exists z1405\n                      (exists z1409\n                        (and\n                          (@ FFun z1402 z1403 t)\n                          (and\n                            (@ App f z1402 z1405)\n                            (and\n                            (@ Seq z1403 z1405)\n                            (and\n                            (@ SeqTo z1404 z1405 D)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App I z1402 z1409)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1409 z1404 v)\n                            (forall z1406\n                            (implies\n                            (in z1406 z1405)\n                            (exists z1407\n                            (exists z1408\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1403 z1406 z1407)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App z1404 z1406 z1408)\n                            (exists z1410\n                            (exists z1411 (and (in z1410 z1397) (and (@ App z1396 z1410 z1411) (@ Pair z1407 z1408 z1411)))))))))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b1aebb86096a232a\" href=\"?note=b1aebb86096a232a\" title=\"ZFC_FAssign\">FAssign</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140c6359fed2eb8a\" href=\"?note=140c6359fed2eb8a\" title=\"ZFC_FFun\">FFun</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"21487f65c94a2183\" href=\"?note=21487f65c94a2183\" title=\"ZFC_FTerm\">FTerm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e67edc6c28bf5962\" href=\"?note=e67edc6c28bf5962\" title=\"ZFC_FVar\">FVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" href=\"?note=ae1f2bbcc1dff983\" title=\"ZFC_Seq\">Seq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" 